# Gerano, 1147
The carriage stopped beneath the towers of Gerano. Nine-year-old Karak stepped down, carrying no family name he could safely claim.
Tyran: You will serve this house, but you will be treated fairly. Your first duty is to protect my daughter, Renia.
Karak: I swear it.
Renia: Then we're family now. You must never betray me.
[end_timeline]
